{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>update as of 30/november/2025:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently being remade in the godot game engine. The game right now is only the &quot;client&quot;. In order to play the game you MUST setup a dedicated server.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while the remake is happening you can still play the game as it was (made with Unity) on the itch.io page</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a steamdeck I had to go to properties -&gt; compatability.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 then check &quot;force the use of a specific Steam Play compatability tool&quot; then select\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0&quot;Steam Linux Runtime 1.0 (scout)&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3297420?t=1764543115","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3297420?t=1764543115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297420/e69cd9a9e0900f19d37b7cd729cd09b870190a82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764543115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297420/e69cd9a9e0900f19d37b7cd729cd09b870190a82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764543115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>update as of 30/november/2025:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_